  "description": "Simple cron-based hosted services for .NET applications, built on top of IHostedService with minimal dependencies. Implement ICronJob, register with AddCronJobHostedService, and your job runs on the cron schedule you define. Supports standard 5-field and seconds-precision 6-field cron expressions.",
