  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of HostedServices.Cron. Provides ICronJob, CronJobHostedService<TCronJob>,\n            and the AddCronJobHostedService DI extension for scheduling recurring background work\n            in .NET applications using cron expressions (5-field standard or 6-field with seconds).",
